{"uid":"4ce6b70f8c4280f3","name":"OIDC provider unreachable: one request with the refresh token, then it is dropped and the popup comes up","fullName":"application.Samples.Feature.signInAgain.SignInAgainPopupTest.providerUnreachable_theTokenIsDroppedThenPopup","historyId":"5690830a1e9e46ffcaf705c18f87c5d5","time":{"start":1789687088597,"stop":1789687214650,"duration":126053},"description":"The token endpoint of the OIDC provider is unreachable. The renewal makes one request with the refresh token and no more: a lost answer does not say whether the provider took the token, and sending the same one again is what ends the whole session, so it leaves the storage instead. The renewal before the next request has nothing left to refresh with and asks with the SSO cookie through the iframe, whose exchange of a code is unreachable as well, so the popup \"Session has expired\" comes up. With the provider back, \"Yes\" leads to the login page.","descriptionHtml":"The token endpoint of the OIDC provider is unreachable. The renewal makes one request with the refresh token and no more: a lost answer does not say whether the provider took the token, and sending the same one again is what ends the whole session, so it leaves the storage instead. The renewal before the next request has nothing left to refresh with and asks with the SSO cookie through the iframe, whose exchange of a code is unreachable as well, so the popup \"Session has expired\" comes up. With the provider back, \"Yes\" leads to the login page.\n<br>\n<br>\n<strong>Manual run:</strong> <code>  \uD83D\uDCCB Copy  application.Samples.Feature.signInAgain.SignInAgainPopupTest#providerUnreachable_theTokenIsDroppedThenPopup </code> into <a href=\"https://github.com/CX-Box/cxbox-code-samples/actions/workflows/build_button_qa.yml\">GitHub Actions</a> → <strong>Run Workflow</strong> → <strong>include PATH</strong>","status":"passed","flaky":false,"newFailed":false,"newBroken":false,"newPassed":false,"retriesCount":0,"retrie